From GreyhavenHQ/greywall PR #103 (open), head 8a80e5e7642fc9c2741cd984867aad3d531f9eb5, against v0.3.7.
The mandatory deny list bound greyproxy's session.key and ca-key.pem read-only over the
denyRead /dev/null masks, so a sandbox could read them. Masks the data dir last instead.

